    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "He does not have evidence. He has a pattern and the patience to wait for it to resolve. That is a worse opponent than a witness.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 32,
      "text": "Chapter 32"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "The Mo family sent word through the academy rather than through the clan, which means they want this settled quietly. Quiet is expensive for them and cheap for me.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 33,
      "text": "Chapter 33"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "Mo Bei came to the academy himself and stood in a classroom doorway as if the doorway owed him the space. I stood up when he entered. It cost nothing and it made his entrance smaller.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
